OL,3,AElation across Serbia after veteran
OL,4,Aruler VuDMiDG concedes to student-led
OL,5,Aprotest movement
OL,6,
OL,7,FSerbia's long-standing leader
OL,8,FAleksandar VuDMiDG has admitted defeat
OL,9,Fto the student-led protest movement in
OL,10,Fsnap parliamentary elections.
OL,12,F"We still do not have final results...
OL,13,Fit is clear that we have lost these
OL,14,Felections," the right-wing populist
OL,15,Fleader said as he conceded late on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
