OL,3,AVenezuelan opposition leader Maria
OL,4,AMachado returns after months in exile
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Trump administration then backed
OL,7,Fhis deputy, Delcy Rodriguez, as leader
OL,8,Fand she was sworn in as interim
OL,9,Fpresident, later signing an oil deal
OL,10,Fwhich granted very favourable terms to
OL,11,Fthe US.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
